    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore The World Of Razgovor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/4b87ddc17e5950cf916049673844fef5.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Razgovor Online provides many places for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are exploring to enjoy the view or looking for new people to meet, There are different locations and different ways to enjoy the open world of Razgovor Online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Providing you with places such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bonsila Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonislashire Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Minstfield Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lux Night Club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Vault Underground</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own experiance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/9186bd35311b2820e28b45f392422daa.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Razgovor provides in game stores for players to customise their character to look however they want to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With more clothes being added in the future there will be no shortage of new ways to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Clothing Stores Such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> UNLOCKED</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cyber Genesis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> HuntersRU</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Razhair</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Your Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/78cc6505eb6e252754910a51043cd560.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Razgovor is an inclusive game for all kind of players and provides an open and welcome experiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wheather youre looking to Roleplay of just Socialize with others, Razgovor provides tones of ways to share your experiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mini Games and Activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/adb00eeda4f0faa72829346547544f22.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Enjoy Mini-Games with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Mini Game includes ways for you to interact with others or with friends without feeling limited to the Main world of Razgovor Online.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore The World Of Razgovor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/4b87ddc17e5950cf916049673844fef5.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Razgovor Online provides many places for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are exploring to enjoy the view or looking for new people to meet, There are different locations and different ways to enjoy the open world of Razgovor Online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Providing you with places such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bonsila Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonislashire Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Minstfield Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lux Night Club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Vault Underground</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own experiance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/9186bd35311b2820e28b45f392422daa.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Razgovor provides in game stores for players to customise their character to look however they want to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With more clothes being added in the future there will be no shortage of new ways to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Clothing Stores Such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> UNLOCKED</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cyber Genesis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> HuntersRU</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Razhair</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Your Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/78cc6505eb6e252754910a51043cd560.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Razgovor is an inclusive game for all kind of players and provides an open and welcome experiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wheather youre looking to Roleplay of just Socialize with others, Razgovor provides tones of ways to share your experiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mini Games and Activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785950/extras/adb00eeda4f0faa72829346547544f22.avif?t=1748585817\" /></div>Enjoy Mini-Games with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Mini Game includes ways for you to interact with others or with friends without feeling limited to the Main world of Razgovor Online.</p>",
